 pay
back, restore;
 enjoy, delight in (acc.). प्र enter, get into (acc. or
loc.);
 pierce, penetrate;
 reach, attain (acc.), enjoy carnally (acc.);
attend to, be bent upon (acc., r. loc.);
 enter, make one's appearance
