 lead home,
marry;
 lay down, place, put etc. in (loc. or acc.);
 appoint, install;
initiate into (acc.);
 write down. अनुप्र enter (after another), get
into or among (acc., r. loc.), resort to (acc.). संप्र enter, go in,
